# Diablo 1's monsters in the unified enemies.rec schema every mod uses (see defs.Monster).
# Converted once from Hellfire's own monstdat table; the engine no longer reads xl_monst.txt.
# Order is content: D1 indexes its monsters by table position.
#
# health and damage are ranges because that is what D1 stores, and Heaven&Hell's "1d3+1" goes
# through the same util.ParseDice -- that is where the two schemas met.

